// - Production: minReplicas: 4, each pod costs $40/month
// - Staging: an identical minReplicas: 4 configuration, same per-pod cost
// - Auto-scaling: production averages 7 replicas during business
//   hours (additional cost beyond the 4-replica baseline)
// - A distributed cache (Module 29 lesson 4): 2 dedicated nodes at
//   $25/month each, originally justified by a specific, measured
//   read-latency improvement

